Theorem DIAGONAL_IMP_SYMMETRIC_MATRIX : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall A :e R :^: idx N :^: idx N, diagonal_matrix_hl N N A -> symmetric_matrix_hl N A.
Admitted.

