Theorem DIAGONAL_MATRIX_MUL : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall A B :e R :^: idx N :^: idx N, diagonal_matrix_hl N N A /\ diagonal_matrix_hl N N B -> diagonal_matrix_hl N N (matrix_mul N N N A B).
Admitted.

