Theorem ORTHOGONAL_MATRIX_ALT : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall A :e R :^: idx N :^: idx N, orthogonal_matrix_hl N A <-> matrix_mul N N N A (transp N N A) = mat N N 1.
Admitted.

